id: brood-parent-first-effect
name: Brood Parent
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 5
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: brood-parent
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Brood Parent's first effect, as a Maneuver: 5(T) Ki, a Duplicate Minion a Size Category smaller than you.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action and a Ki Point Cost of 5(T), create a Duplicate Minion. Your Duplicate Minion’s base Size Category is 1 Size Category smaller than yours.

---

# Its Ki paid as the Maneuver's; the Minion and its Size said (chat.mjs broodMinion) - the Minion itself the table's.
[on used]
broodMinion();
